          "filename": "Minato Mirai In Blue.jpg",
          "caption": "Took some Advil in the afternoon after waking up with a migraine-like sinusitis. I remembered that I still ought to shoot Mt. Fuji from the Yokohama port but then it was blocked with clouds. I took this 'tourist' shot ,yet again, of Minato Mirai instead. \nThe D300 does this great job of flattening the contrast on the fly but too bad I had to settle with my D80's D-lighting PP for now. \n\nMinato Mirai, Yokohama City, Japan.",
